- Firing 1 (`payload-condense.txt` 40,849 chars → `codex-condense-return.raw`, filed verbatim also as `codex-condense-return.md`): **REVISE** — (1) the deferral is faithful but the causal claim exceeds the evidence; name owning surfaces + an acceptance test from the filed failures; (2) mechanical-guard dispositions incomplete (command 4 not demanded · commands 2/6/7 outputs deficient on three items · A6 summary corrected to three clean items); (3) motion evidence — record the T204 RETURN as set aside with the gap carried, price the §5 floor basis (0.5 is not < 0.5), give the FED-list deferral its reason, dispose codex-observe's scope; (4) bind the lesson to exact return paths and qualify "verified as real"; (5) cost accounting — 25 before Condense, Cycle 036 comparator unreconciled (18 reported vs 19 by components), A13's re-fire effect unestablished. Disposition: **APPLIED in full** — §9 corrected in place at its two factual errors (A6 count · firing count/comparator) + this §9b (causal qualification + acceptance test · per-command dispositions · RETURN re-disposition + two rule questions named NOT-YET-AMENDED with reason · exact paths · cost form).
