nnot be honestly run; wave size 5 and the standing cadence are CARRIED FORWARD PENDING EVIDENCE, not re-priced. Partial cost evidence that does stand in the filings: 17 verdict-bearing or gate Codex/Jev firings this cycle (Phase A 2 · seat gates 2 · prewave 6 · lenses 5 · condense 2+) produced 1 scored verdict — the cycle's cost is gate-bound, and the A13 index is priced to cut the re-fire count, which is the measurable prediction the next wave's re-price can test (firings per scored item, a count, is the interim cost unit until wall-time instrumentation exists; building that instrumentation is not charged here — it is named as the evidence the re-price waits on). **Authorization scope (firing 2, point 4; firing 3's cure applied):** the full A12.3 clause text was supplied verbatim in firing 3's feed, and firing 3 priced it: the clause covers T199's first completion re-fire (its second HOLD landed this cycle) and does NOT expressly renew authorization for T190/T196/T197 after their spent completion re-fires HOLDed — their next re-fires are therefore marked **PENDING AUTHORIZATION** in §0b.1 above, with HQ as the named consumer, replacing the seat's earlier per-cycle reading and its fallback (both retired by this disposition, not left standing beside it).
